Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Fonts are self-hosted in fonts/ rather than loaded from a CDN. That makes this
repository a redistributor of them, and OFL 1.1 clause 2 requires each copy to
carry the copyright notice and the licence. The upstream licence files are
therefore included verbatim:

  * Outfit    -- SIL Open Font License 1.1 -- fonts/OFL-Outfit.txt
                 Copyright 2021 The Outfit Project Authors
                 https://github.com/Outfitio/Outfit-Fonts

  * DM Mono   -- SIL Open Font License 1.1 -- fonts/OFL-DMMono.txt
                 Copyright 2020 The DM Mono Project Authors
                 https://github.com/googlefonts/dm-mono

Neither family declares a Reserved Font Name, so OFL clause 3 imposes no
naming restriction here. The OFL is a separate licence from Apache-2.0 and is
not superseded by it; the font binaries in fonts/*.woff2 are covered by the OFL
alone, never by the Apache grant above.

The site ships no third-party JavaScript, no analytics, no trackers, and no
external stylesheets. The only JavaScript is a small inline footer-year updater
covered by the code terms above.
